  "description": "Sway is a two-seat swing on an A-frame, with Knight Blue legs and a Cherry Red top beam. Moulded caps sit on top of the legs, and two flat seats hang from the beam on chains. Two children swing side by side, and its listed skills are confidence and social skills. The frame itself covers 10'3\" x 5'10\". Swings travel well beyond their frame, so the safe play area is larger, at 16'3\" x 11'10\". Plan that space before choosing a spot, and keep footpaths away from the front and back of the seats. Sway belongs to the Pinnacle series of our NexLev range and can stand beside any of its towers. The galvanised frame and moulded parts have a 3-year warranty, and bearings and spare parts have 1 year. Ask us for a drawing with the swing zone marked.",
